== Undocumented changes ==
=== Fixes ===
* Fixed an issue where collecting {{i|Knife Piece 1}} on {{s|Downpour}} 2 and using the trapdoor to {{s|Caves}} would send Isaac to {{s|Mines}} instead.
* Fixed an issue where defeating {{e|Mom}} in {{s|Mausoleum}} and using the trapdoor to {{s|Womb}} would send Isaac to {{s|Corpse}} instead, even without killing {{e|Mom's Heart}} with {{i|Knife Piece 1}} and {{i|Knife Piece 2}}.
* Fixed an issue where using a {{p|Holy Card}} would give a permanent innate Holy Mantle effect.
* Fixed an issue where {{c|Tainted Forgotten}} could purchase [[Devil deal]]s for free as The Soul.
* Fixed an issue where {{c|The Lost}}, {{c|Tainted Lost}}, or {{c|Tainted Forgotten}} could purchase items for free with {{t|Store Credit}}, which would never disappear.
* Fixed an issue where rerolling any [[Devil deal]] outside of a {{r|Devil Room}} would crash the game.
* Fixed an issue where rerolling any Devil deals with the [[Item Tags|item tag]] [[Item Tags devilsacrifice|devilsacrifice]] into regular Devil deals, then rerolled back into a sacrifice deal, would cause the item to become free. 
* Fixed an issue where {{m|Fortune Telling Machine}}s, {{m|Hell Game}}s, and {{m|Rotten Beggar}}s would give {{e|Red Heart}}s of a random subtype, rather than the subtypes assigned to each machine/beggar.
* Fixed a crash with a {{t|Cursed Penny}} teleport.
* Fixed the internal item descriptions sometimes showing information about the previous trinket encountered.
* Fixed some trinket icons showing other trinkets in the "My stuff!" menu.
* Fixed {{i|Satanic Bible}} deals blocking the bottom door when the price was a sacrifice.
* Fixed audio issues.

